      "end": 1017,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "He also videographed the entire occurrence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1018,
      "end": 1061,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Later, the petitioner started threatening the victim that he will make her video viral and subsequently, raped her several times.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
